# Story Specification: PostgreSQL full-text search for tickets and projects

**Project:** Work Management System
**Kind:** Story
**Priority:** Medium
**Dev estimate:** 16.0h
**QA estimate:** 4.0h

## Overview

Add a tsvector column to the tickets table populated from title + description. Create a GIN index. Expose a /search endpoint backed by to_tsquery. Frontend: debounced search input with highlighted matches using ts_headline.

## Acceptance Criteria

- [ ] Implementation matches the described behaviour
- [ ] Unit tests cover the main code paths
